===============================================================================
4. DOCKER
===============================================================================

Docker and containerd are enabled and running.

Current Docker storage:
    /var/lib/docker ~1.9 GB

This is mostly regeneratable image/container/runtime state and should not be
treated as primary backup data.

No Docker named volumes were present at inventory time.

Observed Docker networks:
    bridge                  172.17.0.0/16
    dockge_default          172.19.0.0/16
    dozzle-agent_default    172.20.0.0/16
    rest-server_default     172.18.0.0/16

IMPORTANT DN42 NOTE:
    Docker currently uses 172.20.0.0/16 for dozzle-agent_default.

    DN42 uses 172.20.0.0/14.

    ScopeCreep is not currently being used as a DN42 router, so this is not an
    active problem. If ScopeCreep ever participates in DN42 routing, Docker's
    address pools must be moved away from 172.20.0.0/14 first, similar to the
    cleanup already performed on Clanker.

